    {
      "source": "<code>bean</code> - the JavaBean underlying the map",
      "translation": "<code>bean</code> - 映射底层的 JavaBean",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "a new <code>BeanMap</code> instance",
      "translation": "一个新的<code>BeanMap</code>实例",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>key</code> - must be a String",
      "translation": "<code>key</code> - 必须是 String",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>BeanMap</code> instance using the specified bean.\nThis is faster than using the <a href=\"#create(java.lang.Object)\"><code>create(Object)</code></a> static method.",
      "translation": "使用指定的 Bean 创建一个新的<code>BeanMap</code>实例。\n这比使用<a href=\"#create(java.lang.Object)\"><code>create(Object)</code></a>静态方法更快。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>Map</code>-based view of a JavaBean.  The default set of keys is the\nunion of all property names (getters or setters). An attempt to set\na read-only property will be ignored, and write-only properties will\nbe returned as <code>null</code>. Removal of objects is not a\nsupported (the key set is fixed).",
      "translation": "基于 JavaBean 的`Map`视图。默认键集是所有属性名称（getter 或 setter）的并集。尝试设置只读属性将被忽略，而写时属性将返回为<code>null</code>。不支持移除对象（键集是固定的）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Helper method to create a new <code>BeanMap</code>.  For finer\ncontrol over the generated instance, use a new instance of\n<code>BeanMap.Generator</code> instead of this static method.",
      "translation": "用于创建新 <code>BeanMap</code> 的辅助方法。若要更精细地控制生成的实例，请使用 <code>BeanMap.Generator</code> 的新实例，而不是此静态方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the property of a bean. This allows a <code>BeanMap</code>\nto be used statically for multiple beans--the bean instance tied to the\nmap is ignored and the bean passed to this method is used instead.",
      "translation": "获取 Bean 的属性。这允许将 `<code>BeanMap</code>` 静态地用于多个 Bean——与 Map 关联的 Bean 实例被忽略，而是使用传递给此方法的 Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the property of a bean. This allows a <code>BeanMap</code>\nto be used statically for multiple beans--the bean instance tied to the\nmap is ignored and the bean passed to this method is used instead.",
      "translation": "设置 Bean 的属性。这允许静态地使用 `<code>BeanMap</code>` 处理多个 Bean——与 Map 关联的 Bean 实例将被忽略，而是使用传递给此方法的 Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Limit the properties reflected in the key set of the map\nto readable properties.",
      "translation": "将映射键集中反射的属性限制为可读属性。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Limit the properties reflected in the key set of the map\nto writable properties.",
      "translation": "将映射键集中反射的属性限制为可写属性。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the bean currently in use by this map.",
      "translation": "返回当前由该 Map 使用的 Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the type of a property.",
      "translation": "获取属性的类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Change the underlying bean this map should use.",
      "translation": "更改此映射应使用的底层 Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
